users/citadelculture/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Part of #1856, **option 3 only**: the Windows gnullvm cross shards say plainly when their tests didn't run.\n\nThe cross shards (`Bazel test on windows-latest for x86_64-pc-windows-gnullvm shard N/4`, `bazel.yml` `test-windows-shard`) skip their `bazel test shard` step without authenticated BuildBuddy execution, and they still report success. Their notice said only that \"the native MSVC validation job remains mandatory\".\n\n**Change** (reporting and docs only):\n- **`bazel.yml`:** when a shard skips, its `::notice::` and job summary say: \"Windows gnullvm cross shard N/4: its bazel test step did NOT run because authenticated remote execution (BuildBuddy) is unavailable. The native Windows lane runs most crates' unit and integration tests; see docs/ci.md (#1856). The native MSVC validation job remains mandatory.\" The shard number comes from a `SHARD` step env.\n- **`docs/ci.md`:** a bullet documenting the cross shards, and that they skip and still report success. Per review, the native-lane details are left to the maintainers' part (b) PR, and the nightly line is unchanged.\n- **`.github/scripts/test_windows_integration_disclosure.py` (new):** runs the detection step's own script with and without a key, and checks the outputs, the summary, the step gates and the docs.\n- **Unchanged:** which tests run, the `enabled` outputs and every `if:`, credential gates, platforms, compatibility markers, and job outcomes. Integration tests aren't enabled, and no Windows run is claimed.\n\n**Checks (macOS):**\n- **Test:** 4/4. On main's files the disclosure tests fail, and the \"unchanged\" controls pass on both sides.\n- **Prettier:** `npx prettier@3.5.3 --check .github/workflows/bazel.yml docs/ci.md` passes, so `repo-checks` is fixed.\n- **YAML:** `bazel.yml` parses.\n- **`.github/scripts` suite:** its local failures are identical on main and on head.\n\nBase `d0002812b4aed3032580cc47b661cf394097cc5c`, head `d359ed66ee9c1c452a96d458aa9ac56e0704bcc4`, DCO signed off.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-08T15:47:12Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:44:46Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"citadelculture:ci/issue1856-windows-integration-disclosure","ref":"ci/issue1856-windows-integration-disclosure","repo":{"id":1388907652,"node_id":"R_kgDOUskMhA","name":"CorbanuTerminal","full_name":"citadelculture/CorbanuTerminal","owner":{"login":"citadelculture","id":209115483,"node_id":"U_kgDODHbZWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209115483?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture","html_url":"https://github.com/citadelculture","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Corbanu Terminal: a capital-markets-focused AI coding and agent terminal.","homepage":"https://corbanucore.github.io","language":null,"visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"wat